WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.670 line:0%
-Hey, I'm Alessia Cara,
and this is "Three Scoops."

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.738 line:0%
One of my secret talents --
I wouldn't --

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:07.273 line:0%
I don't know
if it's, like, a talent,

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.708 line:0%
but I, like, really love
to do a British accent

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.611 line:0%
or an Australian one.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:15.315
I'm like...
It's hard to transition. Um...

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:18.117
[Australian accent] Or I like
to do an Australian accent.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.353
It's not as good.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.622
[Normal voice] I'm still trying
to perfect my Owen Wilson.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.823
I'm trying to get there.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.124
I'm trying to just
perfect the, like...

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:26.292
[as Wilson] Wow.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.527 line:0%
[Normal voice]
That's all I've got for now.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:29.529 line:0%
One thing that people
tend to love,

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.598 line:0%
and especially singers
tend to love,

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:34.267 line:0%
that I cannot stand is tea.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.702
And I know that
it doesn't work in my favor

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:39.305
'cause if I loved it,
then I should be drinking it

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.839
every day 'cause it's so good
for your voice.

00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:42.274
It's healthy for you.

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:44.911
I just hate it. All kinds.
I'm not a fan.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.913
So that doesn't really
come in handy

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.982
when I'm hoarse like today.

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:52.719 line:0%
My dream collaboration?
I mean, so many people.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.520
I would love to work with
Anderson .Paak

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:59.024
or Chris Martin, um, or --
Who else?

00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:00.993
I mean, well, Amy Winehouse.
Obviously, she passed away,

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:02.828
but I would've loved
to work with her.

00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:04.663
I don't know
if she was a fan of mine.

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:05.965
Thank you, guys, so much.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:07.901
I'm Alessia Cara, and this
has been "Three Scoops."

